WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.219
Guide six: your finished video.

2
00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:05.523
When a video is finished, it plays

3
00:00:05.523 --> 00:00:07.174
right at the top of its card.

4
00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.693
Press play to watch it.

5
00:00:09.293 --> 00:00:11.294
Click Open MP4 to find the file on

6
00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:13.513
your computer, ready to upload.

7
00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:16.004
Thumbnail: you get two to pick from.

8
00:00:16.004 --> 00:00:17.326
The one in use is marked.

9
00:00:17.326 --> 00:00:18.883
Click Use this one to swap.

10
00:00:19.482 --> 00:00:21.411
Voice: play the voiceover, one part

11
00:00:21.411 --> 00:00:22.502
per section.

12
00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:25.026
Pictures: see what's on screen for

13
00:00:25.026 --> 00:00:26.742
every line. Click one picture to

14
00:00:26.742 --> 00:00:28.341
change just that one.

15
00:00:28.941 --> 00:00:30.778
Captions: this shows your caption

16
00:00:30.778 --> 00:00:32.561
look, drawn on the video.

17
00:00:33.161 --> 00:00:35.182
The look is set once, for the whole

18
00:00:35.182 --> 00:00:37.049
channel. In Your channel, pick one

19
00:00:37.049 --> 00:00:38.861
of twelve ready-made looks.

20
00:00:38.861 --> 00:00:40.508
It also sets the captions, the

21
00:00:40.508 --> 00:00:42.580
music, and the voice's style.

22
00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.004
And in the Voice step, choose how

23
00:00:45.004 --> 00:00:46.362
your voiceover is made:

24
00:00:46.362 --> 00:00:48.086
the look's own voice, a voice you

25
00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:49.967
describe, your own voice, or a ready

26
00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:51.998
voice you can listen to first.

27
00:00:52.598 --> 00:00:54.269
Under Advanced, you can change how

28
00:00:54.269 --> 00:00:55.793
sharp the video is, up to 4K, and

29
00:00:55.793 --> 00:00:57.179
turn captions, music and sound

30
00:00:57.179 --> 00:00:58.438
effects on or off.

31
00:00:59.038 --> 00:01:01.169
Next: your Shorts.
